name: Mandate Authority
type: Coordination/Authority
description: >
  Authority evidence backed by a Mandate/Mandate document. On a Timeline
  Entry, the containing actor claims to act on behalf of actor under mandate.
  The mandate value may be materialized inline or represented as an equivalent
  pure { blueId: ... } reference.

actor:
  type: Coordination/Actor
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Actor on whose behalf the containing actor claims to act.

mandate:
  type: Mandate/Mandate
  schema:
    required: true
  description: >
    Initial mandate document authorizing the represented authority relationship.
    A feeder or provider resolves the exact processed mandate state required for
    the relevant action timestamp.
